WEBVTT

00:02:29.875 --> 00:02:31.143
You can --

00:02:31.167 --> 00:02:35.018
if you love anything, you can work hard
and you can accomplish anything you want.

00:02:35.042 --> 00:02:38.559
So, they raised five all-American kids.

00:02:38.583 --> 00:02:39.893
I am the youngest --

00:02:39.917 --> 00:02:43.309
you can see I'm the one
with the eyes closed there --

00:02:43.333 --> 00:02:46.393
and they named actually my sister and I,
Jennifer and Jonathan,

00:02:46.417 --> 00:02:49.684
after Jennifer and Jonathan Hart
from that TV show "Hart to Hart."

00:02:49.708 --> 00:02:51.893
(Laughter)

00:02:51.917 --> 00:02:55.018
So that's how much
they loved America, apparently.

00:02:55.042 --> 00:02:57.434
And they thought
that we were The Kennedys --

00:02:57.458 --> 00:02:58.726
my mom specifically --

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:01.101
so she dressed us up
all the time like each other